# pipenv
#   According to pypa/pipenv#598, it is recommended to include Pipfile.lock in version control.
#   However, in case of collaboration, if having platform-specific dependencies or
#   dependencies that have no cross-platform support, pipenv may install dependencies
#   that don't work well or not at all on other platforms, so this environment is better committed
#   to version control.
#   For more details, see https://pipenv.pypa.io/en/latest/advanced.html#pipfile-vs-pipfile-lock
#Pipfile.lock

